ов: `bridges/opencode-zen-bridge/server.py, bridges/opencode-zen-bridge/tests/test_realtime_reasoning.py, bridges/opencode-zen-bridge/tests/test_step_interruption.py` (ровно 3 целевых файла `coder_target_files`).\n\n## Сводка `acceptance_coverage` из `coder.json`\n- {\"id\": \"RW-001\", \"status\": \"PASS\", \"test\": \"test_c12_rw001_control_errors_are_terminal_main_sse_json; test_c12_rw001_main_control_disconnect_and_deadline_are_neutral; test_c12_rw001_drain_reject_preserves_neutral_exceptions\", \"evidence\": \"40 main SSE/JSON control-error/status subcases: cancel/reply/interrupt failures -> ServeSecurityError, interrupt attempted, one spawn, no Run.execute fallback; 8 neutral main subcases + drain exception/status matrix. See ~/work/cli-agent-bridge/coder-15-20261028/c12-final2.log and final serial suite logs.\"}\n- {\"id\": \"RW-002\", \"status\": \"PASS\", \"test\": \"test_c12_rw002_json_retry_preserves_partial_output_and_usage; test_c12_rw002_run_retry_preserves_partial_output_and_usage\", \"evidence\": \"JSON stall/prompt_status/transient retries preserve both reasonings, clean/dedup content and 22/13/7 tokens; Run watchdog/CLI retries preserve reasoning/text/chunks and component usage, discard failed native calls/tool blocks. English and exact Russian interruption markers covered. See ~/work/cli-agent-bridge/coder-15-20261028/c12-final2.log and final serial suite logs.\"}\n- {\"id\": \"RW-003\", \"status\": \"PASS\", \"test\": \"test_c12_rw003_drain_activity_extends_window_but_not_hard_deadline; test_c12_rw003_main_passes_attempt_deadline_to_active_drain\", \"evidence\": \"0.15 s window with 0.08 s events lasts 0.4 s and publishes two calls only after step.ended. Silence/foreign session do not extend; hard deadline caps active stream. Real _serve_one_attempt forwards deadline and preserves tail. See ~/work/cli-agent-bridge/coder-15-20261028/c12-final2.log and final serial suite logs.\"}\n- {\"id\": \"RW-004\", \"status\": \"PASS\", \"test\": \"test_c12_rw004_unmapped_exhaustion_returns_diagnostic_json; test_c12_rw004_unmapped_exhaustion_transport_matrix\", \"evidence\": \"Exact JSON 200/stop diagnostic; serve/run x SSE/JSON under local cap, total spawn cap and denied retry. SSE leading newlines normalized only for cross-transport comparison. See ~/work/cli-agent-bridge/coder-15-20261028/c12-final2.log and final serial suite logs.\"}\n\n## Поштучная матрица `REQ-001..REQ-020` и `AC-001..AC-026`\n\n| Требование / AC | Реализация в коде | Автотесты / Оракулы | Свидетельство L2 / L3 | Статус |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| `REQ-001` / `AC-001`, `AC-002`, `REQ-020` / `AC-026` (реалтайм-стриминг дельт `reasoning_content` и `content` `<=250 мс`, побайтовая сохранность маркеров в `reasoning_content`, доставка `session.text.delta` из окна дренажа и при `emulate_tools=True`, Red→Green на сокете при идущем апстриме без падения в `setUp` на `origin/dev`) | `bridges/opencode-zen-bridge/server.py` (`_map_serve_event` для событий `session.*` (`session.reasoning.delta`, `session.text.delta`, `session.tool.input.delta`, `session.tool.called`, `session.step.ended`, `session.execution.failed`, `session.step.failed`) и `permission.asked` / `form.created`, `_serve_one_attempt`, `_drain_serve_step_usage`, `_LockedWfile`) | `bridges/opencode-zen-bridge/tests/test_realtime_reasoning.py` (`test_ac026_realtime_chunks_before_upstream_end`, `test_c11_rw001_drain_text_delivered_once_with_native_tool`, `test_c11_rw003_initial_writes_fail_closed`, `test_c11_rw003_status_socket_timeout_before_model_token`, `test_c11_rw004_callback_error_logged_and_socket_aborted`, `test_c10_rw003_reasoning_markers_preserved_text_clean`, `test_c10_rw005_locked_wfile_timeout_and_abort_without_lock`, `test_c10_rw005_slow_client_bounded_cleanup_and_slot_released`) | `L2-RED-sensitivity` (`rc=1` на `origin/dev`) + `VER-001-pytest` (`rc=0` на кандидате) | `PASS` |\n| `REQ-002` / `AC-003` (неизменность публичного HTTP/OpenAI SSE контракта `/health`, `/v1/models`, `/v1/chat/completions`, `:9883`) | `bridges/opencode-zen-bridge/server.py` | `tests/test_realtime_reasoning.py` | `VER-001-pytest`, `VER-002-unittest` (`rc=0`) | `PASS` |\n| `REQ-003` / `AC-004` (kill-switch `REALTIME_SERVE_ENABLED` в `dynamic_config.json`, дефолт `false`, сохранение `opencode run --format json` и `disable-serve`) | `bridges/opencode-zen-bridge/server.py` (`DYNAMIC_CONFIG_PATH`, `_ServeHealth`, fallback decision table) | `tests/test_realtime_reasoning.py`, полный существующий набор `tests/` | `VER-001-pytest` (`rc=0`) | `PASS` |\n| `REQ-004`, `REQ-005` / `AC-005`, `AC-006`, `AC-007` (первая реакция `< 1.0 с` с префиксом `[мост]` и `\n`, ведущий `\n` после незавершённой дельты, побайтовая сохранность `reasoning_content`, отсутствие `[мост]` в `_messages_to_prompt`) | `bridges/opencode-zen-bridge/server.py` | `tests/test_realtime_reasoning.py` (`test_c5_rw002_limiter_delay_half_second_still_emits_first_status_under_1s`, `test_c10_rw003_reasoning_markers_preserved_text_clean`), `tests/test_step_interruption.py` | `VER-001-pytest` (`rc=0`) | `PASS` |\n| `REQ-006`, `REQ-007` / `AC-008`, `AC-009`, `AC-010` (раздельные watchdogs `first_event_timeout`, `first_token_timeout`, `stall_timeout` с env-порогами в SSE и non-stream JSON `Run.execute` без классификации как `provider_fatal`) | `bridges/opencode-zen-bridge/server.py` | `tests/test_realtime_reasoning.py` (`test_c7_rw001_json_run_watchdog_oexit_reason_and_phase_timings`, `test_c7_rw003_legacy_sse_watchdog_records_breaker_failure_with_and_without_output`, `test_c6_rw002_legacy_first_token_timeout_respects_configured_value_under_120s`, `test_c6_rw003_nonstream_json_run_execute_enforces_phase_watchdogs`) | `VER-001-pytest` (`rc=0`) | `PASS` |\n| `REQ-008` / `AC-011`, `AC-012` (группа процессов `--serve-helper` + `opencode serve`, ранний дренаж `stderr`, фазовые потолки `_serve_http`, общий бюджет `_AuxIoBudget` (`_AUX_IO_BUDGET_S = 54.0` с применением остатка к заголовкам prompt, подписке до первого SSE и управляющим вызовам), прерываемое ожидание в `_StartupGate`/`_SpawnRateLimiter` по `deadline`/`is_client_gone`, детекция закрытия сокета `<= 5 с`, `0` сирот `<= 7 с` включая `skip_body=True` на капающем `interrupt`/`DELETE`) | `bridges/opencode-zen-bridge/server.py` (`_AuxIoBudget`, `_LockedWfile`) | `tests/test_realtime_reasoning.py` (`test_c11_rw002_execution_wait_excluded_from_prompt_budget`, `test_c11_rw002_exhausted_before_prompt_starts_no_http`, `test_c11_rw002_security_control_time_debited_main_and_drain`, `test_c11_rw002_first_sse_budget_across_real_attempts`, `test_c11_rw002_prompt_headers_use_remaining_aux`, `test_c10_fu002_aux_budget_three_subscriptions_deterministic`, `test_c10_fu002_exhausted_aux_budget_starts_no_attempt`, `test_c8_fu002_pre_spawn_gate_and_limiter_respect_deadline_and_client_disconnect`, `test_c7_rw004_startup_http_phases_enforce_own_budget_under_long_request_deadline`, `test_c6_rw005_spawn_serve_respects_deadline_and_client_disconnect_without_run_fallback`, `test_c6_rw006_spawn_serve_drains_multi_mib_stderr_before_bind_without_deadlock`, `test_c6_rw007_fu003_dripping_interrupt_delete_still_cleans_up_under_7s`) | `VER-001-pytest` (`rc=0`) | `PASS` |\n| `REQ-009` / `AC-013`, `AC-014` (`MAX_TOTAL_SPAWNS=3`, `FAIL_RETRY_LIMIT`, `_RetryBudget`, сохранение накопленных `reasonings`, нормализованного `text` и `usage` по всем попыткам в `_serve_json_serve` и `Run.execute`, разделение `_has_model_output` и `_delivered_err` при раннем 429/503 после `session.execution.started`, перехват `first_event_timeout` с ретраем на `serve` без нелегального фолбэка на `run`, нейтральный локальный `timeout` без ложного инкремента CB, барьер доставки `headers_at` и `first_event_at` против фолбэка на `run`, Full Jitter, Circuit Breaker, разделитель `[мост]`) | `bridges/opencode-zen-bridge/server.py` | `tests/test_realtime_reasoning.py` (`test_c12_rw002_json_retry_preserves_partial_output_and_usage`, `test_c12_rw002_run_retry_preserves_partial_output_and_usage`, `test_c8_rw001_early_transient_error_after_execution_started_retries_serve_without_run_fallback`, `test_c8_rw003_request_deadline_timeout_is_neutral_for_circuit_breaker`, `test_c7_rw002_execution_started_before_prompt_headers_sets_delivered_and_blocks_run_fallback`, `test_c6_rw001_headers_at_blocks_run_fallback_on_sse_error_and_timeout`, `test_c5_rw001_prompt_headers_then_body_error_or_429_blocks_run_fallback`), `tests/test_step_interruption.py` | `VER-001-pytest` (`rc=0`) | `PASS` |\n| `REQ-010`, `REQ-011`, `REQ-012` / `AC-015`, `AC-016`, `AC-017` (инкрементальный `ToolCallParser`, отложенная публикация нативных `tool_calls` строго после подтверждённого без ошибок `session.step.ended` в `_finish_serve_tool_step` с продлением окна дренажа при активном потоке событий, `finish_reason=\"tool_calls\"`, полная матрица `STEP_RECOVERY` на `serve` и `run` с передачей `_strip_interrupted(reasoning)` в `_incomplete_step_signal` при сохранении сырых байт `reasoning_content`, сравнительный `unmapped recovery` `serve` против `run` включая 200 OK с диагностикой при исчерпании в `_serve_json_serve`, политика `ask_reject` (default) для встроенных инструментов с отклонением `permission.asked` через `reject` и fail-closed `interrupt` + `ServeSecurityError` при любой ошибке управляющего HTTP в main и drain, `form.created` `safety_order` `cancel+interrupt`, валидация суррогатов `_combine_surrogates` -> `ServeProtocolError`) | `bridges/opencode-zen-bridge/server.py` (`_finish_serve_tool_step`, `_drain_serve_step_usage`, `_incomplete_step_signal`) | `tests/test_realtime_reasoning.py` (`test_c12_rw001_control_errors_are_terminal_main_sse_json`, `test_c12_rw001_drain_reject_preserves_neutral_exceptions`, `test_c12_rw001_main_control_disconnect_and_deadline_are_neutral`, `test_c12_rw003_drain_activity_extends_window_but_not_hard_deadline`, `test_c12_rw003_main_passes_attempt_deadline_to_active_drain`, `test_c12_rw004_unmapped_exhaustion_returns_diagnostic_json`, `test_c12_rw004_unmapped_exhaustion_transport_matrix`, `test_c11_rw005_completed_text_preserves_reasoning_without_retry`, `test_c10_rw002_unconfirmed_tool_not_published_retry_b_only`, `test_c10_rw001_drain_form_created_fails_closed_without_tool`, `test_c10_rw001_drain_permission_reject_continues_and_reasoning_delivered`, `test_c10_rw001_drain_error_classification_preserved`, `test_c9_rw001_idless_and_unconfirmed_native_step`, `test_c8_rw002_unpaired_surrogate_raises_serve_protocol_error_in_sse_and_json`, `test_c6_rw004_ac016_serve_step_interruption_matrix`, `test_c6_rw004_ac017_unmapped_recovery_serve_vs_run_equivalence`), `tests/test_step_interruption.py` | `VER-001-pytest` (`rc=0`) | `PASS` |\n| `REQ-013`, `REQ-014`, `REQ-015`, `REQ-016` / `AC-018`, `AC-019`, `AC-020`, `AC-021` (ротация прокси, строгая валидация `usage`, потолок `_MAX_SERVE_NATIVE_TOOLS = 128` и учёт UTF-8 размеров `call_id`, `name`, `text` и `input` в `_ServeToolState` / `_serve_tool_state_bytes` / `_serve_accumulated_bytes`, работа `_drain_serve_step_usage` от общей очереди событий `events` с сохранением лимитов байт SSE-строки и HTTP-тела, маскирование пароля serve и секретов, `O-EXIT/v1` с `transport`, `first_event_ms`, `ttft_ms`) | `bridges/opencode-zen-bridge/server.py` (`_serve_env`, `OPENCODE_DB=\":memory:\"`, `_ServeToolState`, `_serve_tool_state_bytes`, `_drain_serve_step_usage`, `O-EXIT/v1`) | `tests/test_realtime_reasoning.py` (`test_c11_rw006_name_and_id_caps_main_and_drain`, `test_c10_rw004_tool_count_and_state_bytes_caps`, `test_c10_rw004_tool_state_byte_cap_main_and_drain_cleanup`, `test_c9_fu001_serve_queue_and_accumulated_byte_budget_enforced`, `test_c8_fu001_multiple_native_tool_calls_same_step_preserved_next_step_excluded`, `test_c7_fu001_native_tool_call_captures_step_ended_usage`, `test_c6_fu001_fu002_sse_line_body_byte_caps_and_strict_usage_ints`, `test_c6_fu001_oversized_sse_line_is_terminal_invalid_event`), `tests/test_run_env.py` | `VER-001-pytest` (`rc=0`) | `PASS` |\n| `REQ-017` / `AC-022`, `AC-023` (приведе