в: `bridges/opencode-zen-bridge/server.py, bridges/opencode-zen-bridge/tests/test_realtime_reasoning.py, bridges/opencode-zen-bridge/tests/test_step_interruption.py` (ровно 3 целевых файла `coder_target_files`).\n\n## Сводка `acceptance_coverage` из `coder.json`\n- {\"id\": \"RW-001\", \"status\": \"PASS\", \"test\": \"test_c12_rw001_control_errors_are_terminal_main_sse_json; test_c12_rw001_main_control_disconnect_and_deadline_are_neutral; test_c12_rw001_drain_reject_preserves_neutral_exceptions\", \"evidence\": \"40 main SSE/JSON control-error/status subcases: cancel/reply/interrupt failures -> ServeSecurityError, interrupt attempted, one spawn, no Run.execute fallback; 8 neutral main subcases + drain exception/status matrix. See ~/work/cli-agent-bridge/coder-15-20261028/c12-final2.log and final serial suite logs.\"}\n- {\"id\": \"RW-002\", \"status\": \"PASS\", \"test\": \"test_c12_rw002_json_retry_preserves_partial_output_and_usage; test_c12_rw002_run_retry_preserves_partial_output_and_usage\", \"evidence\": \"JSON stall/prompt_status/transient retries preserve both reasonings, clean/dedup content and 22/13/7 tokens; Run watchdog/CLI retries preserve reasoning/text/chunks and component usage, discard failed native calls/tool blocks. English and exact Russian interruption markers covered. See ~/work/cli-agent-bridge/coder-15-20261028/c12-final2.log and final serial suite logs.\"}\n- {\"id\": \"RW-003\", \"status\": \"PASS\", \"test\": \"test_c12_rw003_drain_activity_extends_window_but_not_hard_deadline; test_c12_rw003_main_passes_attempt_deadline_to_active_drain\", \"evidence\": \"0.15 s window with 0.08 s events lasts 0.4 s and publishes two calls only after step.ended. Silence/foreign session do not extend; hard deadline caps active stream. Real _serve_one_attempt forwards deadline and preserves tail. See ~/work/cli-agent-bridge/coder-15-20261028/c12-final2.log and final serial suite logs.\"}\n- {\"id\": \"RW-004\", \"status\": \"PASS\", \"test\": \"test_c12_rw004_unmapped_exhaustion_returns_diagnostic_json; test_c12_rw004_unmapped_exhaustion_transport_matrix\", \"evidence\": \"Exact JSON 200/stop diagnostic; serve/run x SSE/JSON under local cap, total spawn cap and denied retry. SSE leading newlines normalized only for cross-transport comparison. See ~/work/cli-agent-bridge/coder-15-20261028/c12-final2.log and final serial suite logs.\"}\n\n## Поштучная матрица `REQ-001..REQ-020` и `AC-001..AC-026`\n\n| Требование / AC | Реализация в коде | Автотесты / Оракулы | Свидетельство L2 / L3 | Статус |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| `REQ-001` / `AC-001`, `AC-002`, `REQ-020` / `AC-026` (реалтайм-стриминг дельт `reasoning_content` и `content` `<=250 мс`, побайтовая сохранность маркеров в `reasoning_content`, доставка `session.text.delta` из окна дренажа и при `emulate_tools=True`, Red→Green на сокете при идущем апстриме без падения в `setUp` на `origin/dev`) | `bridges/opencode-zen-bridge/server.py` (`_map_serve_event` для событий `session.*` (`session.reasoning.delta`, `session.text.delta`, `session.tool.input.delta`, `session.tool.called`, `session.step.ended`, `session.execution.failed`, `session.step.failed`) и `permission.asked` / `form.created`, `_serve_one_attempt`, `_drain_serve_step_usage`, `_LockedWfile`) | `bridges/opencode-zen-bridge/tests/test_realtime_reasoning.py` (`test_ac026_realtime_chunks_before_upstream_end`, `test_c11_rw001_drain_text_delivered_once_with_native_tool`, `test_c11_rw003_initial_writes_fail_closed`, `test_c11_rw003_status_socket_timeout_before_model_token`, `test_c11_rw004_callback_error_logged_and_socket_aborted`, `test_c10_rw003_reasoning_markers_preserved_text_clean`, `test_c10_rw005_locked_wfile_timeout_and_abort_without_lock`, `test_c10_rw005_slow_client_bounded_cleanup_and_slot_released`) | `L2-RED-sensitivity` (`rc=1` на `origin/dev`) + `VER-001-pytest` (`rc=0` на кандидате) | `PASS` |\n| `REQ-002` / `AC-003` (неизменность публичного HTTP/OpenAI SSE контракта `/health`, `/v1/models`, `/v1/chat/co